{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare an unapproved reusable draft; no execution."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component. The helper receives the raw inputs mapping and is called at module scope, assigning result. Absent key -> category omitted, optional_channel null; explicit null -> category unset, optional_channel null; exact integer -80..-70 -> category accepted, optional_channel original; other -> category bad, optional_channel null. No exceptions, coercion, defaults, host calls, imports, or Tool dispatch. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation was performed by this example reviewer.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-fresh-presence-helper", "description": "optional_channel absent -> category omitted/null; null -> unset/null; exact integer -80..-70 -> accepted/original; other -> bad/null. Exact result keys category and optional_channel. No exceptions/coercion/defaults/host/imports. Unapproved target-typed-inputs draft only.", "content": "def classify_fresh(mapping):
